Xiangsheng Genealogy / 相声家谱
================================

Code in this repository is released under the MIT License (see LICENSE).

The seed dataset in data/ is a curated, cited compilation of publicly
described teacher–disciple relationships. It is NOT a claim of copyright
over historical facts. Narrative text in data/people/*.json is original
short prose written for this project; facts were checked against the
sources listed in data/sources.json.

