Generation names
----------------

The dataset uses the traditional poem 德寿宝文明 (generations 4–8).
It does not use 德寿喜哈. Generations 1–3 and 9+ have no character in
that poem.

Disputed edges
--------------

Where sources disagree (early origin, dual teachers, self-lowered
generations, or contemporary public narratives), records carry
`"disputed": true`. Treat those rows as research leads, not verdicts.
